You are an experienced programmer and know your way around with the OO way of coding. In this exercise you will learn to make the following improvements:
- Recognize the role of a method that is only called once and implement it
- Find and minimize redundancy
- Reduce repeated and lengthy code
- Refactor to a shorter and more descriptive method or class name

